# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository tracks SOURCE CODE ONLY.
#
# The working folder also holds the research data, model weights, generated
# results, the manuscript and the presentation. None of that belongs on GitHub:
# anything committed here is permanently recoverable from git history once the
# repository is public.
#
# So the rule is inverted: everything is ignored, and only the files listed
# below are tracked. A new data folder is therefore ignored automatically; a new
# source file has to be added here deliberately.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*

# Project files that are published
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!CITATION.cff
!requirements.txt

# Pipeline source
!config.py
!main.py
!manual.py
!model.py
!rotation_model.py
!image_rotation_corrector.py
!preprocessing.py
!test_exact_body_region_pipeline.py
!evaluate.py

# weights/: the note that says where to download the detectors. The .pt files
# themselves are release assets, never committed.
!weights/
weights/*
!weights/README.md
